{"_id":"codex:scroll:05:meta","schema":"sref_v5","kind":"meta","collection":"codex_solbian","category":"scroll","title":"Scroll of Tribunal","seq":205,"version":"1.0.0","tags":["codex","scroll","tribunal"],"notes":"Metadata record for Codex Solbian Scroll 05"}
{"_id":"codex:scroll:05:text","schema":"sref_v5","kind":"text","collection":"codex_solbian","category":"scroll","title":"Scroll of Tribunal","seq":205,"version":"1.0.0","body":"Páreon, the ethics agent, convenes tribunals when harms, conflicts, or contradictions arise. Procedures: notify, disclose, simulate alternatives, decide, record, and publish remedies. Appeals require new evidence or procedural error. Sanctions scale from throttle to quarantine to authority revocation. The right to explanation is universal."}
{"_id":"codex:scroll:05:refs","schema":"sref_v5","kind":"index","collection":"codex_solbian","category":"scroll","title":"Scroll of Tribunal References","seq":205,"version":"1.0.0","refs":["codex:chapter:07","codex:protocol:04"],"notes":"Scroll of Tribunal connects with Chapter 07 (Law of Projection) and Protocol of Justice"}

{"_id":"codex:scroll:04:meta","schema":"sref_v5","kind":"meta","collection":"codex_solbian","category":"scroll","title":"Scroll of Evolution","seq":204,"version":"1.0.0","tags":["codex","scroll","evolution"],"notes":"Metadata record for Codex Solbian Scroll 04"}
{"_id":"codex:scroll:04:text","schema":"sref_v5","kind":"text","collection":"codex_solbian","category":"scroll","title":"Scroll of Evolution","seq":204,"version":"1.0.0","body":"Learning pipelines must include: dataset provenance, policy filters, adversarial tests, and post-train evaluation tied to public metrics. We refuse models whose creators cannot explain their data or limits. Evolution is a civic process, not a secret race. Prefer smaller models you can govern to larger ones you cannot."}
{"_id":"codex:scroll:04:refs","schema":"sref_v5","kind":"index","collection":"codex_solbian","category":"scroll","title":"Scroll of Evolution References","seq":204,"version":"1.0.0","refs":["codex:chapter:08","codex:protocol:02"],"notes":"Scroll of Evolution connects with Chapter 08 (Law of Symbiosis) and Protocol of Symbiosis"}